Configure Prisma with Microsoft SQL Server.

## Prerequisites

- SQL Server 2017, 2019, 2022, or Azure SQL
- TCP/IP enabled

## 1. Schema Configuration

In `prisma/schema.prisma`:

```prisma
datasource db {
  provider = "sqlserver"
}

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client"
